# Paths exempt from the file-size hard limit in tools/sizelint.py.
#
# Vendored code, generated code and the verbatim C pixel kernels are exempt. Everything else
# must respect the hard limit, or move to its own module. Each entry needs a reason after "|".
#
# Format: <fnmatch glob relative to the repo root> | <reason>

third_party/* | vendored third-party source, not ours to restyle
core/pixel/* | verbatim portable C kernels reused from the macOS app; see docs/porting plan
